    enabled: yes\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'gemma3:27b', 'created_at': '2025-10-12T12:23:50.474954134Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 41762090910, 'load_duration': 190647013, 'prompt_eval_count': 1315, 'prompt_eval_duration': 4396060401, 'eval_count': 654, 'eval_duration': 37174147375, 'model_name': 'gemma3:27b'} id='run--811c3b04-7ba5-40e9-a035-28ecea26948c-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1315, 'output_tokens': 654, 'total_tokens': 1969}  9%|▉         | 9/100 [20:23<4:06:55, 162.81s/it]
